## Diagnostic instrumentation added

Read orb-live.ts around line 8145 (novaSystemInstruction computation) —
confirmed this is the exact literal string passed to
`novaClient.connect({ systemInstruction: novaSystemInstruction, ... })`
a few lines later (line 8836), and that `_novaInstructionChars` /
`_novaToolEntryCount` are already stashed here for the connect_failed
OASIS payload (a payload that does NOT fire on the nova_validation path
we're chasing — confirmed empty via a live query for
orb.live.connection_failed in this exact window).

Added a gated emitDiag('nova_instruction_debug_dump', {...}) call right
after novaSystemInstruction is computed, carrying the full text,
instruction_chars, has_guided_topic, guided_topic_id. Gated behind
`process.env.ORB_LOG_NOVA_INSTRUCTION_DEBUG === 'true'`.

$ npx tsc --noEmit
(clean, exit 0)

## Deploy workflow wiring

Added ORB_LOG_NOVA_INSTRUCTION_DEBUG to AWS-STAGE-DEPLOY-GATEWAY.yml's
strip list AND re-add list (value:"true"), same established pattern as
ORB_FULL_DUPLEX_ENABLED / ORB_DAY_CLOSE_RUNG_ENABLED. Deliberately did
NOT touch AWS-PROD-DEPLOY-GATEWAY.yml — the dumped text carries the real
user's memory/personalization context.

